5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I worry about who pays for what. Last time it was messy.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to know the total cost before we commit. No surprises.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to understand why we felt crowded or alone last year.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I hate losing days to travel. I need a quick trip.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I sleep badly away from home. I need to know the room setup.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, if we rent a whole place, the bill is one number.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, yes, but I need to see if that number is final.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, how much time did we lose travelling last year?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, two full days. It felt like a punishment.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, I just want to know if there is a private bathroom.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will check the pricing for whole houses.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the all-in rates versus separate meals.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will check how last year's days actually ran.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look at the ferry and train times.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the bathing hours and bathroom provision.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Also, I will check what separately booked rooms cost last time.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,And I will check the valley inn rates versus urban beds.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,"Also, I will check the time alone in the shared-house year.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,And I will check getting around by train and bus.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Also, I will check the inn mealtimes and room arrangements.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
