35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Whole houses are 5,400 yen a head a night. That is one bill.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Valley inns are 17,000 yen with meals. City beds are 12,000 to 20,000.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Last year, two of us didn't meet all day. We were apart.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The ferry takes two days. The train to the valley is ninety minutes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Island houses have one bathroom for everyone. The water runs cold.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, 17,000 yen is high, but it includes food.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, yes, but the city option has no fixed meal cost.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, ninety minutes is much better than two days.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, exactly. I want to be there, not travelling.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, one bathroom is a problem for me. I need privacy.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, the city option has separate rooms with doors.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, the inn has futons in one room. That might be tight.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Victoria, the inn keeps us together. The city lets us drift.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, I prefer the train. The ferry is too slow.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Midori, I am worried about the shared room at the inn.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I think the city option is fairer for paying.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I prefer the inn. The cost is clear and includes meals.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,I want us to be together. The inn does that.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The inn is reachable by train. That is the only one I like.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I am hesitant about the inn, but the city feels too lonely.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
