64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option C has a shared room. Option B has private rooms.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, I agree. The all-in rate is safer for the group.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, yes. I don't want to track individual expenses.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
